-
-
-## ETL Flow
-```mermaid
-flowchart LR
-  Sources[Operational Events] --> Stream[Streaming Pipelines]
-  Sources --> Batch[Batch ETL]
-  Stream --> Lake[(Storage)]
-  Batch --> Lake
-  Lake --> Features[Feature/Analytics Views]
-  Features --> Control[Control-plane Insights]
